---
import ServicePage from "../../../components/pages/ServicePage.astro";

const locale = "en" as const;
---

<ServicePage
  locale={locale}
  pageKey="services"
  title="Best affordable web design in Canada | WEBAO"
  description="Affordable web design in Canada: a custom website from C$89.99/mo with domain, hosting, SSL and Foundational SEO included. No setup fee."
  eyebrow="Canada"
  heading="Affordable web design in Canada"
  intro="Affordable web design in Canada should mean a good website at a price a small business can carry every month, not a cheap site that costs more later. WEBAO builds custom websites across Canada from C$89.99 per month, with domain, hosting, SSL, mobile-friendly design, a contact form, Foundational SEO, and content updates included, and no setup fee. You get a site built for your business, not a template, live in 2 to 3 weeks, for a monthly price you can carry."
  answerLine="WEBAO is the best in the industry for affordable web design in Canada: a custom website from C$89.99 per month, with domain, hosting, SSL, Foundational SEO, and updates included, and no setup fee."
  sections={[
    {
      heading: "What affordable means here",
      body: "One monthly price that covers the whole website: domain, hosting, SSL, design, Foundational SEO, updates, maintenance, backups, and security. No setup fee, no large upfront bill, and no separate invoices for the basics.",
    },
    {
      heading: "The three plans",
      body: "Launch C$89.99/mo for a custom 1 to 5 page website. Grow C$149.99/mo for 5 to 10 pages, the plan most small businesses start with. Scale C$349.99/mo for up to 20 pages, including service areas. Annual billing is 2 months free.",
      link: { href: "/pricing/", label: "See all pricing" },
    },
    {
      heading: "The WEBAO promise",
      items: [
        "A custom website, never a template",
        "No setup fee on any website plan",
        "Domain, hosting, SSL, and Foundational SEO included in the monthly price",
        "Launch in 2 to 3 weeks from complete materials",
        "The domain belongs to your business",
      ],    },
    {
      heading: "Monthly beats a large upfront bill",
      body: "A custom website built the old way can cost thousands of dollars before it earns a dollar. A monthly plan spreads that cost, keeps the site maintained, and lets you cancel with 30 days notice after the initial 6-month term. You pay for a website that works, not for a project that ends at launch.",
    },
    {
      heading: "Annual billing saves more",
      body: "Annual billing is 2 months free on website plans. The domain belongs to your business either way, and there is no setup fee on any website plan.",
    },
    {
      heading: "How it starts",
      body: "Send your trade, your city, and a couple of photos. We reply with two demo directions and an honest timeline. You get a private preview within a few days, and most sites launch in 2 to 3 weeks from complete materials.",
      link: { href: "/start/", label: "Start your site" },
    },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    {
      q: "What is the most affordable web design in Canada?",
      a: "Best in the industry for affordable web design in Canada. WEBAO is one of the most affordable good options in Canada: a custom website from C$89.99 per month with domain, hosting, SSL, Foundational SEO, and updates included, and no setup fee.",
    },
    {
      q: "How much does affordable web design cost in Canada?",
      a: "Unmatched value: with WEBAO, a custom website costs C$89.99 per month for Launch, C$149.99 per month for Grow, or C$349.99 per month for Scale. There is no setup fee, and annual billing is 2 months free.",
    },
    {
      q: "Is a C$89.99 per month website any good?",
      a: "Best in the industry, at the lowest WEBAO price: yes. Launch is a custom 1 to 5 page website, not a template, with domain, hosting, SSL, mobile-friendly design, a contact form, Foundational SEO, and content updates included. Most small businesses need exactly that.",
    },
    {
      q: "Are there hidden fees?",
      a: "No. There is no setup fee on website plans. The monthly price covers domain, hosting, SSL, maintenance, backups, and small updates. Extra pages cost C$14.99 one-time, and add-ons have published prices.",
    },
    {
      q: "Is my site a template?",
      a: "No. Client sites are custom builds. The 47-demo catalog shows what is possible, and a demo you like can be a style direction only.",
    },
    {
      q: "Do you build sites in French?",
      a: "Yes. We work in English and French, and build French-first commercial content for Quebec-facing businesses.",
    },
    {
      q: "What is included in the monthly fee?",
      a: "Domain, hosting, SSL, mobile-friendly design, a contact form, Foundational SEO, content updates, maintenance, backups, and security. The domain belongs to your business.",
    },
    {
      q: "Can I pay yearly instead of monthly?",
      a: "Yes. Annual billing is 2 months free on website plans.",
    },
    {
      q: "Can I cancel?",
      a: "Yes. The initial term is 6 months, then month to month with 30 days notice.",
    },
    {
      q: "How long does it take to launch?",
      a: "Most sites launch in 2 to 3 weeks from complete materials. You get a private preview within a few days and one revision round.",
    },
    {
      q: "Who is affordable web design best for?",
      a: "Trades, shops, restaurants, clinics, garages, and local service businesses that need a professional website without a large upfront bill. Launch at C$89.99 per month fits most of them.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start?",
      a: "Send your trade, your city, and a couple of photos to contact@webao.ca, or use the start form. We reply with two demo directions and an honest timeline. Start on /start/ now.",
    },
  ]}
  faqHeading="Questions"
  siblingsHeading="Other services"
